Project Report — my-website
A complete handover document. Written to be pasted at the top of a future chat so work can continue without re-discovery.

1. Overview
A Laravel CMS with a public-facing site and an admin panel. The admin manages pages, blog posts, categories, a navigation menu builder, and global look-and-feel settings. Content is edited with CKEditor 5 (self-hosted, GPL build). Admin authentication is Laravel Breeze.

2. Environment
Framework	Laravel 12
Auth	Laravel Breeze (Blade stack)
Build	Vite 7.3.6
CSS	Tailwind CSS v3 + @tailwindcss/forms
JS	Alpine.js, Axios
Editor	CKEditor 5 v48.5.0 (npm, GPL build)
Database	SQLite (database/database.sqlite)
Local server	php artisan serve at http://127.0.0.1:8000
OS	Windows
Shell	PowerShell
Project root	C:\Users\marcl\Desktop\my-website
