14. Task priorities if work continues
Ranked by ease × usefulness.

Run npm run build and update the CKEditor CSS hash in four blades (mechanical, ~2 minutes).

Delete the three dead controllers (mechanical, ~1 minute).

Fix the two CSS typos in admin/settings/index.blade.php (mechanical, 30 seconds).

Convert admin/categories/index.blade.php to @extends('layouts.admin') for visual consistency.

Add a slug migration for posts, put slug back in Post::$fillable — enables stable URLs.

Wire primary_color / accent_color / border_radius to elements — add Tailwind class→CSS-variable mappings or explicit CSS rules.

Extract the settings @php block and CSS variables into a shared partial.

None are critical. The app works as-is.